>**{c=red:If you have any other }{n:Borghertz's|Borghertz}{c=red: Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest!}**
\**Note:** You do NOT need to be on Summoner when OPENING the coffer, only when accepting the quest. A {p:Grotto Coffer Key} and a {i:Mythril Beastcoin|Mythril Beastcoin|749} (if you don't have access to {p:Proto-Waypoints|Proto-Waypoint}) are required for this quest.
* The **Coffer** Key can be purchased from any {p:Curio Vendor Moogle} if the player owns the {@k} {k:Rhapsody in Umber} {p:Key Item} obtained through the {p:Rhapsodies of Vana'diel} story progression.
* The lock can be picked as a {p:Thief}.
* Alternatively, these mobs in the area will drop the key: {m:Blubber Eyes}, {m:Bog Sahagin}, {m:Marsh Sahagin}, {m:Razorjaw Pugil}, {m:Rock Crab} and {m:Swamp Sahagin}.

Coffer chests can spawn at (H-7), (I-9), (H-8), (G-6), (F-6), (G-10), (F-9), (D-9) and (E-11) behind the **Mythril Door** in Map 3.
=2 Walkthrough
!Sea Serpent Grotto Composite Updated.png|right|Sea Serpent Grotto Composite Map
* Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with {n:Guslam} in {z:Upper Jeuno} (H-8) on {p:Summoner} to begin the quest.
* Head to the {z:Sea Serpent Grotto}:

:* Speak to any {p:Unity NPC} and use the {p:Unity Warp} (Level 125) to reach {z:Sea Serpent Grotto}, Map 4 (L-5). This teleport will save you some time. You'll be teleported in front of the **Gold Door** (blank target). Open it and proceed north. Follow the left wall and you'll find the **Mythril Door** (again, blank target), keep examining it until you see a message about 'mythril dust' and trade a Mythril Beastcoin to open it.

>**OR**
:* You can use the {p:Proto-Waypoint} to teleport to (J-5) in Map 3 behind the **Mythril Door**.

* Find and open a Coffer in one of the locations mentioned above. You will receive a key item {@k} {k:Old gauntlets} from the coffer.
* Return to {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak to {n:Guslam}. He will inform you he is unable to repair the gauntlets.
* If this is your first AF you must do the following, otherwise skip these steps:
** Speak to {n:Deadly Minnow} inside of the Durable Shields shop.
** Head to {z:Lower Jeuno} inside the Tenshodo area. Speak with {n:Yin Pocanakhu} at (J-8) and then trade 1,000 {p:Gil} to continue.
* Go to {z:Port Jeuno} and head to the crates near the AH and Jeuno Duty-Free Shop at (H-8).
* Click on the **???** to receive a cutscene.
* Travel to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and go to (F-8) on the first map.
* Click on one of the torches to spawn {m:Dark Spark}.
* Once {m:Dark Spark} is defeated, examine one of the torches for the key item {@k} {k:Shadow flames}.
* Return to Port Jeuno and examine the **???** again. After the cutscene, the quest is complete.

=2 Two Additional Coffers
{n:Guslam} mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones with the corresponding coffer key:
* {z:Temple of Uggalepih} - {@i:Evoker's Doublet|12650} {i:Evoker's Doublet|Evoker's Doublet|12650}
* {z:Toraimarai Canal} - {@i:Evoker's Pigaches|14103} {i:Evoker's Pigaches|Evoker's Pigaches|14103}
** These coffers are not required to complete the quest, therefore after you receive your hands the quest is "completed".
** The quest must either be active or completed in order to receive these attire pieces.
** You **must** have {p:Summoner} as your main job when you open these coffers.

